  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Ingegerd Råman正穿着围裙在工作室里忙碌。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/15/3f/153fec9247b31b21de51f00cb6223b06.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
